    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对飞机系统进行能控性数学检验会得出俯仰平面运动既可由升降舵控制也可由副翼控制的结论，但在实际中试图通过副翼使飞机滚转来控制飞行高度是不切实际的。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "A mathematical test of controllability for the airplane system would conclude that pitch plane motion is controllable by the ailerons as well as by the elevator, but it is impractical to attempt to control an airplane's altitude by rolling the aircraft with the ailerons.",
